  "prompts": {
    "image": "NEW photorealistic 16:9 film frame, restrained performance close-up. Image1 is mandatory exact man's identity, age, long brown hair; omit umbrella/outdoors. Image2 locks tight face framing, nose slightly screen right, natural skin, lighting and blurred station wall background. Make the quiet START of a subtle reaction, BEFORE any tear or hand movement. Same tight eye-level close-up, forehead partly cropped, chin near bottom, face about 75% image width, realistic 85mm perspective. His eyes calmly listen toward offscreen right, lips closed and relaxed, eyebrows in natural neutral position. Slight habitual tiredness, emotionally contained and attentive, not sad, not smiling. Both cheeks completely dry, no tear, no shiny wet trail, no hand, no feather visible in this tight crop; feather remains on shoulder outside crop. No change to clothing, face proportions, hair, wall or practical lighting. Skin naturally textured, not glamour smoothed. No dramatic expression, no crying eyes, no red eyes, no magical effects, no writing or watermark. This must be a believable neutral baseline for a tiny involuntary tear and restrained embarrassment in the end frame.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Łza i zakłopotanie — stan końcowy zgodny z zatwierdzonym planem.",
    "animation": "One restrained three-second reaction, locked close-up. His CLOSED MOUTH remains neutral and motionless throughout: corners level, cheeks relaxed, no lip compression or upward pull. 0-1s: ONE small tear forms beneath his SCREEN-RIGHT eye and slides a short distance down that cheek. He senses it and briefly arrests his gaze; the upper eyelids open slightly. 1-2s: One eyebrow rises a few millimetres; his eyes shift toward screen right to check whether anyone noticed. This is startled self-conscious vigilance. 2-3s: He holds the supplied End Frame expression, with the single tear still visible and mouth neutral. Head and jaw stay nearly still. @Image1 is facial identity and hair only; ignore its hand and feather. Preserve exact face, skin, wall and lighting. No smile, smirk, grin, cheek lift, sadness, sobbing, speaking, extra tear, props or cut."
